            "We conduct experiments on three datasets involving multi-step reasoning, including two recent multi-hop Question Answering datasets: 2WikiMultiHopQA \\cite{ho2020constructing} and R4C \\cite{inoue-etal-2020-r4c}, and a scientific dataset \\cite{talmor2020leap} for reasoning over taxonomic relations. Our experimental results show (1) effectiveness of the iterative scheme; \n",
