            "$$\n",
            "where at each step $j$, $\\mathcal{M}(T)$ recalls the next piece of knowledge $c_j$ conditioned on the query $q$ and all previously gathered knowledge $c_1, ..., c_{j-1}$ (concatenated with $q$).\n",
