            "Our research question is \\textit{how to shepherd a PLM to recall a series of knowledge and derive a ``chain of thought\" for multi-step reasoning}. To this end, we conduct experiments on several datasets that require complex multi-step reasoning and compare different methods to guide the PLM via prompt/prefix tuning, fine-tuning, and our prompter design. We use both intrinsic and extrinsic metrics to evaluate the quality of recalled knowledge, considering both end answer accuracy and coverage of intermediate evidence.\n",
